ent</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">BotID</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Platform Security</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Web Application Firewall</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"nav-item dropdown\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        Resources\n        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-col-title\">Company</div>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-links\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Customers</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Blog</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Changelog</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Press</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Events</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-col-title\">Learn</div>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-links\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Docs</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Academy</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Knowledge Base</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Community</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-col-title\">Open Source</div>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-links\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Next.js</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Nuxt</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Svelte</a>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"dropdown-link\">Turborepo</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-item\">Solutions</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-item\">Enterprise</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-item\">Pricing</a>\n    </nav>\n    \n    <div class=\"header-actions\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-item\">Ask AI</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-item\">Log In</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Sign Up</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"container\">\n  <section class=\"page-header\">\n    <h1 class=\"page-title\">DeployCloud Blog</h1>\n    <p class=\"page-subtitle\">A tech blog showcasing engineering insights, product updates, and community stories from a cloud deployment platform.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"filters-section\">\n    <div class=\"categories\" id=\"categoryFilters\" role=\"tablist\">\n      <button class=\"category-pill active\" data-category=\"All Posts\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">All Posts</button>\n      <button class=\"category-pill\" data-category=\"Engineering\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Engineering</button>\n      <button class=\"category-pill\" data-category=\"Community\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Community</button>\n      <button class=\"category-pill\" data-category=\"Company News\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Company News</button>\n      <button class=\"category-pill\" data-category=\"Customers\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Customers</button>\n      <button class=\"category-pill\" data-category=\"v0\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">v0</button>\n      <button class=\"category-pill\" data-category=\"Security\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Security</button>\n      <button class=\"category-pill\" data-category=\"Changelog\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Changelog</button>\n      <button class=\"category-pill\" data-category=\"Press\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Press</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"search-box\">\n      <svg class=\"search-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle>\n        <line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"></line>\n      </svg>\n      <input type=\"search\" class=\"search-input\" id=\"searchInput\" placeholder=\"Search posts\" aria-label=\"Search posts\">\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"featured-section\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"featured-card main post-item\" data-category=\"Engineering\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">Engineering</span>\n        <span>Apr 9</span>\n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"featured-title\">Agentic Infrastructure</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-excerpt\">Every generation of software eventually demands a new generation of infrastructure. First, we configured servers by hand. Next, the cloud turned infrastructure into APIs. Then, a more important shift: infrastructure derived from the application itself. LLMs and coding agents are driving the next transition, and it's happening fast.</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"agentic-stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat-title\">Agentic Infrastructure Growth</div>\n        <ul class=\"stat-list\">\n          <li>\n            <svg class=\"stat-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n            <strong>30% of deployments</strong> initiated by coding agents\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <svg class=\"stat-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n            <strong>1000% increase</strong> from six months ago\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <svg class=\"stat-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n            <strong>20 times more likely</strong> to call AI inference providers\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">TR</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Tom Reeves</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"featured-card sub post-item\" data-category=\"Engineering\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">Engineering</span>\n        <span>Apr 16</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"featured-title\">A new programming model for durable execution</h3>\n      <p class=\"card-excerpt\">The gap between prototypes and production-ready systems is huge. Code that's trivial to run locally falls apart the moment it needs to handle failures...</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">PM</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Pranav Mehta</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"featured-card sub post-item\" data-category=\"Company News\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">Company News</span>\n        <span>Mar 30</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"featured-title\">Agent responsibly</h3>\n      <p class=\"card-excerpt\">Coding agents generate code at unprecedented speeds — but without rigorous judgment, they are a fast way to ship bad assumptions directly to production.</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">MC</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Matthew Carr</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </section>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\">Latest News</h2>\n  <div class=\"posts-grid\" id=\"postsGrid\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"post-card post-item\" data-category=\"Engineering\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">General</span>\n        <span>Apr 16</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"post-title\">A new programming model for durable execution</h3>\n      <p class=\"post-excerpt\">The gap between prototypes and production-ready systems is huge. Framework-defined infrastructure solved this for web applications. Workflows extends that model...</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">PM</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Pranav Mehta</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"post-card post-item\" data-category=\"Engineering\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">General</span>\n        <span>Apr 9</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"post-title\">Agentic Infrastructure</h3>\n      <p class=\"post-excerpt\">Every generation of software eventually demands a new generation of infrastructure. LLMs and coding agents are driving the next transition, and it's happening fast.</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">TR</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Tom Reeves</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"post-card post-item\" data-category=\"Security\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">General</span>\n        <span>Apr 6</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"post-title\">Zero Data Retention on AI Gateway</h3>\n      <p class=\"post-excerpt\">Building with multiple AI models means wrestling with fragmented data policies. With many different model providers, it's crucial to ensure zero data retention...</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">J</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Jerlyn and Dan</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"post-card post-item\" data-category=\"Engineering\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">General</span>\n        <span>Apr 2</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"post-title\">Optimizing Sandbox snapshots</h3>\n      <p class=\"post-excerpt\">When we recently shipped filesystem snapshots in Sandbox to let teams capture and restore a sandbox state instantly...</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">T</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Tom, Rob, and 2 others</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"post-card post-item\" data-category=\"Customers\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">Customers</span>\n        <span>Apr 1</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"post-title\">How a startup made a blog platform work for humans and AI alike</h3>\n      <p class=\"post-excerpt\">A two-person, YC-backed startup that built an agentic CMS for businesses, sharing their architecture and workflow...</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">NV</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Nic Vargas</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"post-card post-item\" data-category=\"Engineering\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">Engineering</span>\n        <span>Mar 30</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"post-title\">Making build tool 96% faster with agents, sandboxes, and humans</h3>\n      <p class=\"post-excerpt\">Build tool is now 81–91% faster to compute the task graph in our repositories, scaling with repo size and complexity...</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">AS</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Anthony Shew</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"post-card post-item\" data-category=\"Company News\">\n      <div class=\"card-meta\">\n        <span class=\"card-category\">General</span>\n        <span>Mar 25</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"post-title\">Unified reporting for all AI Gateway usage</h3>\n      <p class=\"post-excerpt\">If you're shipping AI features, you already have usage data. The problem is that it's across providers, keys, and environments...</p>\n      <div class=\"card-author\">\n        <div class=\"author-avatar\">J</div>\n        <div class=\"author-name\">Jerlyn and Dan</div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"#\" cl